function breakdownHTML(c){const rows=[[_T("ค่าตั๋ว"),c.tix,1],[_T("ขนสินค้า"),c.crev,1],[_T("น้ำมัน"),-c.fuelC],[_T("สนามบิน"),-c.feeC],[_T("ดูแลเครื่อง/ลูกเรือ"),-c.fixed],[_T("บริการบนเครื่อง"),-c.svc]];
  const mx=Math.max(1,...rows.map(r=>Math.abs(r[1])));
  return `<div class="stack" style="gap:5px">${rows.map(([n,v,g])=>`<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:118px 1fr 64px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px"><span class="muted">${n}</span><div class="bar" style="height:6px"><i style="width:${Math.abs(v)/mx*100}%;background:var(${g?"--good":"--bad"})"></i></div><span class="num" style="text-align:right">${money(v,true)}</span></div>`).join("")}</div>`}
function spark(cv,h){const dpr=devicePixelRatio||1,W=cv.clientWidth,H=cv.clientHeight;cv.width=W*dpr;cv.height=H*dpr;const x=cv.getContext("2d");x.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);
  const mn=Math.min(0,...h),mx=Math.max(1,...h),bw=W/h.length,Y=v=>4+(mx-v)/(mx-mn)*(H-8);
  x.strokeStyle=cssv("--grid");x.beginPath();x.moveTo(0,Y(0));x.lineTo(W,Y(0));x.stroke();
  h.forEach((v,i)=>{x.fillStyle=cssv(v>=0?"--good":"--bad");const y=Y(v),y0=Y(0);x.fillRect(i*bw+1,Math.min(y,y0),Math.max(1,bw-2),Math.max(1,Math.abs(y0-y)))})}

